OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe deliberate fire at
OL,4,AGlasgow flats after 15 taken to
OL,5,Ahospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are treating a fire at a block
OL,8,Fof flats in Glasgow as deliberate.
OL,10,FFour fire engines were sent to the
OL,11,Ffour-storey building on Copland Road,
OL,12,Fin the Ibrox area, just after 17:00 on
OL,13,FFriday after reports of a fire on the
OL,14,Fground floor.
OL,16,FFirefighters and paramedics initially
OL,17,Fsaid they were dealing with "multiple
OL,18,Fcasualties" and police have now
OL,19,Fconfirmed 15 people were taken to
OL,20,Fhospital as a precaution.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
